{"seq":1,"slug":"saga-compensation","title":"Saga 补偿模式在工作流引擎中的实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/patterns/saga-compensation","wordCount":1789,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"saga-补偿模式在工作流引擎中的实现\">Saga 补偿模式在工作流引擎中的实现</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>引擎托管 Saga</strong>：工作流引擎接管 Saga 的状态持久化、步骤重试、超时管理和崩溃恢复，开发者只需编写正向和补偿逻辑</li>\n<li><strong>补偿栈（Compensation Stack）</strong>：按注册顺序的反向执行补偿操作的数据结构</li>\n<li><strong>幂等补偿</strong>：补偿操作必须幂等——可能因网络超时被重试多次，效果应等同于执行一次</li>\n<li><strong>不可补偿步骤</strong>：某些操作无法语义撤销（如已发邮件），需通过后置、预留-确认或人工升级处理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"从手写-saga-到引擎托管-saga\">从手写 Saga 到引擎托管 Saga</h2><p>在没有工作流引擎的世界里，实现 Saga 模式需要开发者手动处理：状态持久化、补偿触发、重试、超时和恢复。引擎能够接管这些控制面机制，但不能替业务定义“什么算补偿成功”，也不能替外部系统生成幂等回执。</p>\n<p>工作流引擎接管 Saga 的持久控制状态、定时器和 Task 重派发。应用仍需负责正向操作、补偿操作、幂等键、未知结果查询、业务期限与人工升级。把这些责任全部归给引擎，会在第一次“外部写入成功但完成回执丢失”时暴露双重效果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"temporal-中的-saga-实现\">Temporal 中的 Saga 实现</h2><p>在 Temporal 中，Saga 不需要特殊的 SDK 或框架——它就是普通的 <code>try/catch</code> 代码加上一个补偿栈：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function orderSaga(order: Order): Promise&lt;SagaResult&gt; {&#10;  const compensations: Array&lt;() =&gt; Promise&lt;EffectReceipt&gt;&gt; = [];&#10;  const compensationFailures: unknown[] = [];&#10;&#10;  try {&#10;    // Step 1: 创建订单&#10;    const orderOperation = operationId(&#39;create-order&#39;);&#10;    compensations.push(() =&gt; cancelOrder(orderOperation));&#10;    const orderReceipt = await createOrder(orderOperation, order);&#10;&#10;    // Step 2: 扣减库存&#10;    const inventoryOperation = operationId(&#39;reserve-inventory&#39;);&#10;    compensations.push(() =&gt; releaseInventory(inventoryOperation));&#10;    const inventoryReceipt = await reserveInventory(inventoryOperation, order.items);&#10;&#10;    // Step 3: 扣款&#10;    const paymentOperation = operationId(&#39;charge-payment&#39;);&#10;    compensations.push(() =&gt; refundPayment(paymentOperation));&#10;    const paymentReceipt = await chargePayment(paymentOperation, order.userId, order.amount);&#10;&#10;    // Step 4: 创建发货单&#10;    await createShipment(operationId(&#39;create-shipment&#39;), orderReceipt.orderId);&#10;    // 最后一步不需要补偿——如果它成功了 Saga 就完成了&#10;&#10;    return { status: &#39;completed&#39;, orderId: orderReceipt.orderId };&#10;  } catch (error) {&#10;    // 反向执行所有已注册的补偿&#10;    for (const compensate of compensations.reverse()) {&#10;      try {&#10;        await compensate();&#10;      } catch (compError) {&#10;        // 收集失败；所有补偿尝试结束后进入人工处置，不能谎报 compensated&#10;        compensationFailures.push(compError);&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;    if (compensationFailures.length &gt; 0) {&#10;      return { status: &#39;manual_intervention&#39;, failures: compensationFailures };&#10;    }&#10;    return { status: &#39;compensated&#39;, cause: failureSummary(error) };&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orderSaga</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SagaResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> compensations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">EffectReceipt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> compensationFailures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // Step 1: 创建订单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> orderOperation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> operationId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'create-order'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    compensations.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cancelOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orderOperation));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> orderReceipt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orderOperation, order);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // Step 2: 扣减库存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> inventoryOperation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> operationId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reserve-inventory'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    compensations.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> releaseInventory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(inventoryOperation));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> inventoryReceipt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reserveInventory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(inventoryOperation, order.items);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // Step 3: 扣款</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> paymentOperation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> operationId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'charge-payment'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    compensations.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> refundPayment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(paymentOperation));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> paymentReceipt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> chargePayment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(paymentOperation, order.userId, order.amount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // Step 4: 创建发货单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createShipment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">operationId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'create-shipment'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), orderReceipt.orderId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 最后一步不需要补偿——如果它成功了 Saga 就完成了</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, orderId: orderReceipt.orderId };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 反向执行所有已注册的补偿</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> compensate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compensations.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compensate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (compError) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 收集失败；所有补偿尝试结束后进入人工处置，不能谎报 compensated</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        compensationFailures.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(compError);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (compensationFailures.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'manual_intervention'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, failures: compensationFailures };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'compensated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cause: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">failureSummary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(error) };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>示例故意在正向操作前注册补偿，并让正向与补偿共享稳定 <code>operationId</code>。原因是正向 Activity 超时只能说明完成回执未知，不能证明外部效果没有发生；补偿必须能够按同一个操作 ID 查询并撤销已存在的效果，对明确不存在的效果则安全返回“无需补偿”。</p>\n<h2 id=\"补偿栈的设计模式\">补偿栈的设计模式</h2><p>在工作流引擎中实现 Saga 补偿有三种常见模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>内联补偿栈</strong></td>\n<td><code>try/catch</code> + 数组</td>\n<td>简单直观</td>\n<td>步骤 ≤5 的简单 Saga</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Saga 类封装</strong></td>\n<td>专用类管理补偿注册</td>\n<td>可复用，强类型</td>\n<td>通用 Saga 模板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>子工作流补偿</strong></td>\n<td>每步是子工作流</td>\n<td>独立生命周期</td>\n<td>超长时间步骤</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Saga 类封装模式的典型实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class SagaBuilder {&#10;  private steps: Array&lt;{&#10;    forward: () =&gt; Promise&lt;unknown&gt;;&#10;    compensate: () =&gt; Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  }&gt; = [];&#10;&#10;  addStep(forward: () =&gt; Promise&lt;unknown&gt;, compensate: () =&gt; Promise&lt;void&gt;) {&#10;    this.steps.push({ forward, compensate });&#10;    return this;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async execute(): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    const registered: typeof this.steps = [];&#10;&#10;    for (const step of this.steps) {&#10;      registered.push(step);&#10;      try {&#10;        await step.forward();&#10;      } catch (error) {&#10;        // 反向核对并补偿所有可能已产生效果的步骤&#10;        for (const done of registered.reverse()) {&#10;          await done.compensate();&#10;        }&#10;        throw error;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SagaBuilder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    forward</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    compensate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  addStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forward</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compensate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.steps.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ forward, compensate });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> registered</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> typeof</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.steps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> step</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.steps) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      registered.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(step);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 反向核对并补偿所有可能已产生效果的步骤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> done</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> registered.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> done.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compensate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"引擎如何保证补偿的可靠性\">引擎如何保证补偿的可靠性</h2><p>工作流引擎为 Saga 补偿提供了手写代码难以实现的可靠性保证：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[正向步骤执行] --&gt; B{步骤成功?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[记录到事件历史]&#10;    C --&gt; D[继续下一步]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| E[进入补偿流程]&#10;    E --&gt; F[从补偿栈取最后一项]&#10;    F --&gt; G[执行补偿 Activity]&#10;    G --&gt; H{补偿成功?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[记录补偿完成]&#10;    I --&gt; J{还有待补偿?}&#10;    J --&gt;|是| F&#10;    J --&gt;|否| K[Saga 补偿完成]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| L[重试补偿]&#10;    L --&gt; G\">graph TD\n    A[正向步骤执行] --&gt; B{步骤成功?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[记录到事件历史]\n    C --&gt; D[继续下一步]\n    B --&gt;|否| E[进入补偿流程]\n    E --&gt; F[从补偿栈取最后一项]\n    F --&gt; G[执行补偿 Activity]\n    G --&gt; H{补偿成功?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[记录补偿完成]\n    I --&gt; J{还有待补偿?}\n    J --&gt;|是| F\n    J --&gt;|否| K[Saga 补偿完成]\n    H --&gt;|否| L[重试补偿]\n    L --&gt; G</pre><p>关键保证：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>补偿意图可持久恢复</strong>：Worker 崩溃后，引擎能依据历史继续调度尚未确认完成的补偿。</li>\n<li><strong>已确认完成在 Workflow 中只观察一次</strong>：重放会复用完成事件；完成上报前失联的补偿 Activity 仍可能再次尝试。</li>\n<li><strong>补偿有独立策略</strong>：退款、释放预留等操作应根据业务期限设置错误分类、退避和最大尝试，而不是复制正向步骤配置。</li>\n<li><strong>补偿失败有明确终态</strong>：达到预算后进入 <code>manual_intervention</code>，保留正向与补偿回执，交给指定所有者处理。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"补偿设计的关键原则\">补偿设计的关键原则</h2><p>在工作流引擎中设计补偿操作时，需遵循以下原则：</p>\n<p><strong>幂等性（Idempotency）</strong>：补偿操作必须幂等——执行一次和执行多次的效果相同。典型做法是以 Saga 实例 ID、步骤 ID 和动作类型组成幂等键，并让目标系统返回稳定回执。补偿不能每次重试生成新的退款请求 ID。</p>\n<p><strong>依赖显式化</strong>：只有证明两个补偿互不依赖时才能并行。反向顺序是安全起点，不是形式保证；退款和释放库存是否可交换，应由业务不变式和目标系统并发语义证明。</p>\n<p><strong>语义正确性</strong>：补偿不是「撤销」，而是「产生等价的逆效果」。退款不是删除支付记录，而是创建一笔新的退款交易。这保证了审计轨迹的完整性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并行-saga-模式\">并行 Saga 模式</h2><p>当 Saga 中的某些步骤相互独立时，可以并行执行以缩短总耗时，但补偿逻辑变得更复杂：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[开始订单 Saga] --&gt; B[创建订单]&#10;    B --&gt; C[并行执行]&#10;    C --&gt; D[扣减库存]&#10;    C --&gt; E[扣款]&#10;    C --&gt; F[预约配送时间]&#10;    D --&gt; G[等待所有完成]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{全部成功?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[确认订单]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[补偿已成功的步骤]&#10;    J --&gt; K[根据成功集合选择性补偿]\">graph TD\n    A[开始订单 Saga] --&gt; B[创建订单]\n    B --&gt; C[并行执行]\n    C --&gt; D[扣减库存]\n    C --&gt; E[扣款]\n    C --&gt; F[预约配送时间]\n    D --&gt; G[等待所有完成]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{全部成功?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[确认订单]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[补偿已成功的步骤]\n    J --&gt; K[根据成功集合选择性补偿]</pre><p>并行 Saga 中，不能只补偿调用方收到“成功”的步骤，因为超时分支可能已经产生外部效果。每个并行步骤必须暴露按 <code>operationId</code> 查询结果的能力；汇合点先把成功、失败、未知分类，再对“成功或未知”执行核对与选择性补偿。<code>Promise.allSettled</code> 只收集调用结果，不能替代外部状态查询。</p>\n<h2 id=\"saga-与工作流引擎的超时配合\">Saga 与工作流引擎的超时配合</h2><p>工作流引擎的定时器能力让 Saga 的超时处理变得简洁：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>超时场景</th>\n<th>引擎处理方式</th>\n<th>手写实现所需</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单步超时</td>\n<td>Activity <code>startToCloseTimeout</code></td>\n<td>定时器线程 + 状态检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局业务期限</td>\n<td>Workflow durable timer + 显式期限状态</td>\n<td>外部调度器 + 状态持久化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等待外部确认超时</td>\n<td><code>condition(fn, timeout)</code></td>\n<td>轮询 + 状态机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>补偿操作超时</td>\n<td>补偿 Activity 的总体期限、重试预算与人工升级</td>\n<td>死信队列 + 告警</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Workflow 级运行超时是平台保护，不应替代业务期限。平台超时可能直接终止执行，未必给补偿逻辑留下运行窗口；业务截止应由 Workflow 内的持久定时器驱动，并在终止前显式进入补偿或人工处置。</p>\n<p>取消同样不能等同于补偿。取消请求可能在某个 Activity 已产生效果后到达，Activity 也可能尚未观察到取消。Workflow 应先记录取消意图，等待在途步骤返回或查询其回执，再按真实效果集计算补偿计划。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不可补偿步骤的处理\">不可补偿步骤的处理</h2><p>现实中并非所有操作都可以补偿——已发送的邮件无法收回，已打印的发票无法撤销。工作流引擎中处理不可补偿步骤的策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>后置不可补偿步骤</strong>：将不可补偿的操作放在 Saga 的最后执行，这样如果它成功了，Saga 就完成了；如果它失败了，前面的步骤可以正常补偿。</li>\n<li><strong>预留-确认模式</strong>：将不可补偿操作拆成两步——先「预留」（可补偿），确认无误后再「确认」（不可补偿）。如：先冻结额度（可解冻），全部步骤成功后再真正扣款。</li>\n<li><strong>人工干预升级</strong>：当不可补偿步骤的补偿确实需要时，触发人工干预工作流——通过 Signal 通知运维人员处理。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>工作流引擎让 Saga 的补偿意图、期限和尝试可持久恢复，但不承诺外部补偿只执行一次。可靠 Saga 需要稳定操作 ID、权威回执、未知结果查询、有限重试和人工处置终态。补偿是新的业务交易，不是时间倒流。下一节讨论<a href=\"human-in-the-loop\">人工审批环节</a>，<a href=\"versioning-migration\">版本迁移</a>则处理 Saga 逻辑变化时的兼容性。</p>\n<p>Activity 可能重复尝试且完成前失联的边界可对照 <a href=\"https://docs.temporal.io/activity-definition\">Temporal Activity Definition</a>；截至 2026 年 8 月核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Saga 补偿模式在工作流引擎中的实现","id":"saga-补偿模式在工作流引擎中的实现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从手写 Saga 到引擎托管 Saga","id":"从手写-saga-到引擎托管-saga"},{"level":2,"text":"Temporal 中的 Saga 实现","id":"temporal-中的-saga-实现"},{"level":2,"text":"补偿栈的设计模式","id":"补偿栈的设计模式"},{"level":2,"text":"引擎如何保证补偿的可靠性","id":"引擎如何保证补偿的可靠性"},{"level":2,"text":"补偿设计的关键原则","id":"补偿设计的关键原则"},{"level":2,"text":"并行 Saga 模式","id":"并行-saga-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Saga 与工作流引擎的超时配合","id":"saga-与工作流引擎的超时配合"},{"level":2,"text":"不可补偿步骤的处理","id":"不可补偿步骤的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"工作流引擎内核原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/engines/engine-internals"},"next":{"title":"人工审批环节的建模与实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/patterns/human-in-the-loop"}}